ming distance from every previously accepted repaired assignment is at least min_distance. With no accepted candidates this condition is vacuous; min_distance=0 permits duplicate repairs. Return exactly `{feasible_count:integer,repairs:[{candidate_id,original_valid:boolean,edit_distance:integer_or_null,repaired:assignment_or_null}],diverse_selection:[candidate_ids_in_greedy_acceptance_order]}`. Diversity is this declared greedy rule, not global maximum packing. This task does not claim a trained diffusion sampler.\nTask JSON:\n{\"min_distance\":4,\"candidates\":[{\"assignment\":[\"ash\",\"ash\",\"ash\"],\"candidate_id\":\"c7648\"},{\"assignment\":[\"birch\",\"birch\",\"birch\"],\"candidate_id\":\"c4532\"},{\"assignment\":[\"ash\",\"birch\",\"ash\"],\"candidate_id\":\"c6311\"},{\"assignment\":[\"ash\",\"ash\",\"birch\"],\"candidate_id\":\"c4610\"}],\"constraints\":[{\"max\":2,\"min\":2,\"value\":\"ash\",\"kind\":\"count\"},{\"positions\":[0,2],\"kind\":\"different\"}],\"slots\":3,\"alphabet\":[\"ash\",\"birch\"],\"kind\":\"constraint_repair\"}","renderer":"reverse","review_receipt_ids":["expert-RDP-001-extended-pilot-v2-p0011-base-reverse-d4212759bb54","adv-extended-pilot-v2-40fb9f46e30ca0d8fe87","adj-extended-pilot-v2-1d0895236c2d10f4fa9d"],"review_status":"ACCEPTED","reviewed_candidate_hash":"d4212759bb5436de28eb41cfe6493b9fe27782b83bbc1161e2b4ebc3a3ab6932","sample_id":"RDP-001-extended-pilot-v2-p0011-base-reverse","scope_limitation":"Finite exhaustive minimum Hamming repair and declared greedy diversity; no diffusion model or globally optimal packing claim.","semantic_family_id":"RDP-001-extended-pilot-v2-p0011","semantic_parent_id":"RDP-001-extended-pilot-v2-p0011","semantic_task":{"alphabet":["ash","birch"],"candidates":[{"assignment":["ash","ash","ash"],"candidate_id":"c7648"},{"assignment":["birch","birch","birch"],"candidate_id":"c4532"},{"assignment":["ash","birch","ash"],"candidate_id":"c6311"},{"assignment":["ash","ash","birch"],"candidate_id":"c4610"}],"c